{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evergreen Tavern is a Medieval Tavern Simulator where you serve delicious products to the villagers, made from your ingredients grown with love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate and manage your place the way you like it, take care of your crops and animals, engage in relaxing fun activities, explore the world and scary mysterious dungeons, and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/SteamGif_Decorate.gif?t=1747417013\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Tavern the way you like it with a great variety of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/SteamGif_Grow.gif?t=1747417013\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant your crops and take good care of them to improve your harvests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/SteamGif_Serve.gif?t=1747417013\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the fresh products from your garden and farm to prepare delicious dishes and serve drinks to the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/SteamGif_Explore.gif?t=1747417013\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way through mysterious dungeons in search of loot to sell in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will find many more activities in Evergreen Tavern as the game keeps getting updated!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735030?t=1747417013","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstat